{"unit_id":"genius-alray__dsh-plugin-forge-cnb#card-zh","repo":"genius-alray/dsh-plugin-forge-cnb","commit":"d0061784ce3e378b47dbd291c1627332ad1af765","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-forge-cnb 是面向 DSH 的 CNB forge provider，接入合并请求与工作树面板。它把 CNB 合并请求信息映射到 DSH forge：展示状态、可合并性、检查和评审者，读取差异补丁与提交文件，并支持发布评审和合并。插件还能从 Git 远程地址或合并请求网址识别仓库与请求，供会话关联使用。适合在 CNB 上托管代码、希望在 DSH 中查看和处理合并请求的开发者。运行需 Node.js 22 以上，并使用 CNB CLI 登录凭据或 CNB_TOKEN。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:9-15","src/provider.js:256-278","src/provider.js:297-338","src/provider.js:487-510","src/provider.js:601-624","src/api.js:54-60"]}
{"unit_id":"genius-alray__dsh-plugin-forge-cnb#card-en","repo":"genius-alray/dsh-plugin-forge-cnb","commit":"d0061784ce3e378b47dbd291c1627332ad1af765","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-forge-cnb connects CNB merge requests to the DSH forge panel. It shows status, checks, and reviewers; reads diffs and files; and supports reviews and merges. It also matches Git remotes and request URLs to sessions. Requires Node.js 22+ and CNB CLI credentials or CNB_TOKEN.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:9-15","src/provider.js:256-278","src/provider.js:297-338","src/provider.js:487-510","src/provider.js:601-624","src/api.js:54-60"]}
