{"unit_id":"genius-alray__dsh-plugin-forge-cnb#feature-review-status","repo":"genius-alray/dsh-plugin-forge-cnb","commit":"d0061784ce3e378b47dbd291c1627332ad1af765","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-forge-cnb 的功能「合并请求状态」：面板读取 CNB 合并请求、提交状态和评审者信息，并整理成 DSH forge 快照。打开合并请求详情时还能获取完整检查列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/provider.js:297-338","src/map.js:47-90"]}
