{"unit_id":"genius-alray__dsh-plugin-forge-cnb#feature-diff-file","repo":"genius-alray/dsh-plugin-forge-cnb","commit":"d0061784ce3e378b47dbd291c1627332ad1af765","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-forge-cnb 的功能「查看差异与文件」：读取合并请求文件列表并拼装统一 diff，也可读取指定提交的文件文本，供 DSH 面板查看代码变更。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/provider.js:487-530","src/diff.js:99-140"]}
{"unit_id":"genius-alray__dsh-plugin-forge-cnb#feature-review-merge","repo":"genius-alray/dsh-plugin-forge-cnb","commit":"d0061784ce3e378b47dbd291c1627332ad1af765","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-forge-cnb 的功能「提交评审与合并」：用户确认后可发布合并请求评审，或选择合并方式执行合并；提交前会重新核对请求的 head 提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/provider.js:434-478","src/provider.js:601-624"]}
{"unit_id":"genius-alray__dsh-plugin-forge-cnb#caveat-credentials","repo":"genius-alray/dsh-plugin-forge-cnb","commit":"d0061784ce3e378b47dbd291c1627332ad1af765","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-forge-cnb 使用前须知：请求 CNB API 需要有效凭据；默认读取本机 ~/.cnb/token，也可用 CNB_TOKEN 环境变量提供令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/api.js:54-94"]}
{"unit_id":"genius-alray__dsh-plugin-forge-cnb#caveat-limit","repo":"genius-alray/dsh-plugin-forge-cnb","commit":"d0061784ce3e378b47dbd291c1627332ad1af765","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-forge-cnb 使用前须知：CNB 无法通过此 API 取消 WIP/草稿状态，需到 CNB 网页修改标题；差异文件列表最多读取 300 项，超大合并请求的差异和增删统计可能不完整。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/provider.js:410-423","README.md:92-98"]}
